 "notes": [
  "Total is 59 as published; the post's section headers say Locations(10) but only nine locations are listed (the other counts match).",
  "Posted Objective 'ISB' matches no objective available in January 2002 (ISB Operations / Empire's Sinister Agents is a later Virtual card), so it is printed as written; no starting cards are listed.",
  "Posted 'Death StarDocking Bay' dested Death Star: Docking Bay 327 (Dark), not Death Star II: Docking Bay, because the post says Death Star; 'Cloud CityDocking Bay' dested Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay), the only Dark Cloud City docking bay; 'HothIce Plains' dested Hoth: Ice Plains (5th Marker).",
  "Posted 'Coruscant', 'CoruscantDocking Bay' dested the Special Edition Dark printings (matching the Special Edition Coruscant: Imperial Square); 'CoruscantGalactic Senate' dested the Dark Coruscant-set site.",
  "Posted 'Sebulba' under Podracer(1) dested Sebulba's Podracer; posted 'Takeel x2' is listed under Interrupts and Takeel is an Interrupt; Evader and Monnok are posted separately, not as the combo.",
